  "details": "Currently, there is a translation update system in \"l-test\". I would like to be able to use it on a live branch as well.\n\nIt has several benefits:\n\n- Developers don't have to update the translations when the new version is released\n\n- Translation fixes can be applied without updating VRChat\n\nBut also it has some disadvantages:\n\n- Users can modify translation file\n\n- The report of translation from users may be inaccurate (Cannot be identified from the build number)\n\nHowever, the translation update system needs to be separate for l-test and live. that is like a nightly build and stable build.\n\nThe translation update system in live will be like this:\n\n- Translations will be updated automatically every day or week (at UTC+00:00)\n\n- Checking the translation updates automatically when the game starts\n\n- Have separate APIs for l-test and live (for l-test check work)",
